/T (Context and Trends: The global real estate sector continues to experience steady growth, driven by urbanization, technological innovation, and the increasing demand for sustainable developments. In Africa, the real estate market is evolving rapidly, with heightened interest in mixed-use developments and hospitality real estate, spurred by a growing middle class and increasing foreign direct investment \(FDI\).)
