/S /H3
/T ( A pivotal development in early 2024 was the landmark real estate deal between Egypt and ADQ \(Abu Dhabi Developmental Holding Company\), an Abu Dhabi investment fund, to develop the Ras el-Hekma Mediterranean resort. This strategic partnership has injected a substantial boost into the economy, with immediate inflows of US$35 billion, comprising US$24 billion in foreign direct investment \(FDI\) and US$11 billion from the conversion of ADQ's foreign currency deposits. The project's full implementation is projected to attract up to US$150 billion in investments dedicated to infrastructure and real estate, exerting a transformative impact on both sectors.)
/E ( A pivotal development in early 2024 was the landmark real estate deal between Egypt and ADQ \(Abu Dhabi Developmental Holding Company\), an Abu Dhabi investment fund, to develop the Ras el-Hekma Mediterranean resort. This strategic partnership has injected a substantial boost into the economy, with immediate inflows of US$35 billion, comprising US$24 billion in foreign direct investment \(FDI\) and US$11 billion from the conversion of ADQ's foreign currency deposits. The project's full implementation is projected to attract up to US$150 billion in investments dedicated to infrastructure and real estate, exerting a transformative impact on both sectors.)
